{"id":"31cbbeaa392f6458","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-local-binary-instance-code.md","title":"Binary Instance Codes in the Local Presentation","display":"df-local-binary-instance-code — Binary Instance Codes in the Local Presentation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-local-binary-instance-code","aliases":["92-df-local-binary-instance-code"],"display":"df-local-binary-instance-code — Binary Instance Codes in the Local Presentation","source":"第 VII 章 pp. 87–89（PDF 104–106）；本地有效重编码","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-local-binary-instance-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-local-binary-instance-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-binary-instance-code — Binary Instance Codes in the Local Presentation"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 pp. 87–89（PDF 104–106）；本地有效重编码"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_G,\\mathrm{Dec}_G,\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(C_G,\\mathrm{Dec}_G,\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 是本地码像、逆解码与编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2\\)</span> 是同时实例操作。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_G:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Pi_G:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为下文定义的全码函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> 为固定矛盾句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}binary\\text{-}instance\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Pi_G(e,m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(e);\\bar m,\\bar n)\\urcorner,\n&amp;e\\in C_G,\\ \\mathrm{Dec}_G(e)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(e))\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\},\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner,&amp;\\text{其他情形}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}binary\\text{-}instance\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Pi_G(e,m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(e);\\bar m,\\bar n)\\urcorner,\n&amp;e\\in C_G,\\ \\mathrm{Dec}_G(e)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(e))\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\},\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner,&amp;\\text{其他情形}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是把原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_E\">\\(\\Pi_E\\)</span> 的用途译入既有本地语法的构造，不冒称复现其十三进制数值。合法公式分支的结论码是确切同时实例的码；非法分支只提供总性，不用于任何合法公式的等价推理。</p>\n<p>合法序列码识别、解码、公式及自由变量识别、有限递归代入和重新编码均可计算，故此函数可计算。相同逻辑公式的不同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 写法可能有码差异；下游只在所选确切实例的码与其可证性之间使用等价。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 pp. 87–89（PDF 104–106）；本地有效重编码。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-encoding-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-contradiction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C_G,\\mathrm{Dec}_G,\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_G:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}binary\\text{-}instance\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Pi_G(e,m,n)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(e);\\bar m,\\bar n)\\urcorner,\n&e\\in C_G,\\ \\mathrm{Dec}_G(e)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(e))\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\},\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner,&\\text{其他情形}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1965,"backlinks":[{"id":"64779d4d642bf6b2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8a3cbbd03d905ffa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]] → [[92-df-weak-separation]] → [[92-lem-shepherdson-representation]] → [[92-thm-shepherdson-representation]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]]"}],"outgoing":["8bd18c4d476f594a","bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","51c43e0240787ebb"]}